«
@@ ============================================================
@@ MinTofDV — flight time minimising TrCost ΔV for a fixed departure date
@@ 1-D ternary search; iteration count set by AstronTXPrecision.
@@ Author & design         : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@
@@ Input  : t₁ 'Af' 'Bf' tof_lo tof_hi   ( t₁ 'Af' 'Bf' tof_lo tof_hi -- { ΔV tof } )
@@ Output : { ΔV tof }
@@ VALIDATION (device-confirmed):
@@   1 'AstronTXPrecision' STO
@@   2459054 'Ⓛ♁Pf' 'Ⓛ♂Pf' 150 225 MinTofDV -> { 6.32099 205.66 }
@@ ============================================================
 → t1 Af Bf toflo tofhi
  « 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 → lo hi m1 m2 dv1 dv2 tofopt niter
    «
      '3·AstronTXPrecision+3' EVAL 'niter' STO
      toflo →Num 'lo' STO  tofhi →Num 'hi' STO
      1 niter START
        'lo+(hi-lo)/3' EVAL 'm1' STO
        'hi-(hi-lo)/3' EVAL 'm2' STO
        t1  t1 m1 +  Af Bf ⓁTrCost 1 GET 'dv1' STO
        t1  t1 m2 +  Af Bf ⓁTrCost 1 GET 'dv2' STO
        IF dv1 dv2 < THEN m2 'hi' STO ELSE m1 'lo' STO END
      NEXT
      'lo+(hi-lo)/2' EVAL 'tofopt' STO
      t1  t1 tofopt +  Af Bf ⓁTrCost 1 GET
      tofopt  2 →LIST
    »
  »
»
